cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Agentic tuning run data: LCLS and FACET-II, June-July 2026"
message: "If you use this data or code, please cite the paper it supports."
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Zhang
    given-names: Zhe
    affiliation: SLAC National Accelerator Laboratory
license: BSD-3-Clause
repository-code: "https://github.com/REPLACE-ME/agentic-runs"
abstract: >-
  Raw optimizer archives and runner logs from the agent-orchestrated tuning
  campaigns on the LCLS hard X-ray line (26 June 2026) and the FACET-II
  injector (1-2 July 2026), with the code that turns them into the figures and
  tables of the accompanying paper.
